  "description": "Ji-Han Han, a normal university student who lived an ordinary life, got into a work accident and already said goodbye to his life, but suddenly he got a chance from an unknown god to resurrect in another world! \n\n*\"Can I see the level and skills?\"\n\n\"Use your skills to level up. Distribute stats and use items.\"\n\n\"Am I in another world as a playable character?\"\n\n* Ji-Han Han came to the fantasy world with the powers of a playable character. Now he will play under the name of Rudin in another world!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
